+Show Configuration
+------------------
+
+To see the current configuration of your application, use the :func:`config <cli.config_command>` command.
+The output is formatted as JSON. Sensitive values, such as keys containing
+"SECRET", "PASSWORD", "TOKEN", or "KEY", are masked. ::
+
+    $ flask config
+    {
+      "DATABASE_URL": "url",
+      "SECRET_KEY": "***"
+    }
+
